sequenceDiagram
    actor Owner
    participant Hermes as Hermes + MCP
    participant API as AgentPass / Vercel
    participant DB as Neon Postgres
    participant R as Razorpay
    actor Payer
    Owner->>API: Set allowance, cap and approved services
    API->>DB: Save policy and audit event
    Hermes->>API: Request service (scoped token + request ID)
    API->>DB: Lock workspace, check policy, reserve budget
    DB-->>API: Atomic decision
    alt Request denied
        API-->>Hermes: Blocked with reason - no payment order
    else Request allowed
        API->>R: Create INR order
        R-->>API: Provider order ID
        API-->>Hermes: Checkout URL - payment pending
        Hermes-->>Payer: Ask for checkout confirmation
        Payer->>R: Confirm UPI or credit card payment
        R-->>API: Signed callback or webhook
        API->>R: Independently fetch payment
        R-->>API: Exact order, amount, INR and captured status
        API->>DB: Settle reservation, append signed receipt
        Hermes->>API: Query original request ID
        API-->>Hermes: Sample service result and Ed25519 receipt
    end
    Note over API,R: Public rehearsal simulates checkout - no real money moves.
    Note over Owner,Payer: Live payments require activated merchant credentials and payer confirmation.
